import_events needs rebuilding on top of GISMO Arrival and Catalog classes.
probably Trace too. Or at least on top of +antelope.dbgetarrivals


* Uses **only modern core GISMO objects** (`Catalog`, `Arrival`, `waveform`, `scnlobject`)
* Is **format-agnostic** (Antelope, Seisan, etc., via `Catalog.retrieve`)
* Reproduces the **EQTC / EQWF matrix concept**
* Is **testable, modular, and refactor-safe**
* Lives in **`contributed/`**, not `core/`

---

